New summer uniform catalog for warehouse teams

Hello from Thistlecrest Uniforms,

Our summer catalog is out, and this one leans on the crews who spend the
whole shift on a concrete floor. The work shirts are cut from a lighter
poplin this year, and the hi-vis vests hold their color through a season
of industrial laundering.

New this season:

  * Short and long sleeve work shirts in a lighter summer poplin
  * Class 2 hi-vis vests with a mesh back panel and two radio loops
  * Cotton twill work pants cut for a boot, in three inseams

Logo setup is free on any order over $500, so a company crest on the
left chest costs nothing extra. Sizes run small through 5XL in every
line, and we will send a fit sample in any size if a crew wants to try
one on before ordering.

See the catalog:
https://links.sendbarrow-mail.example/c/7710/2205/c3/c23372ccc3cd8de7

Thanks for taking a look. We are glad to price out a whole crew if that
is easier than working down the list line by line.

Odalys Wrenfield
Customer Accounts, Thistlecrest Uniforms

--
